@startuml
title Nestory - UML Deployment Diagram

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor #ECFDF5
  BorderColor #047857
}
skinparam artifact {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
}
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #64748B
}

node "Android Device\n<<device>>" as AndroidDevice {
  node "Android OS / Runtime\n<<execution environment>>" as Runtime {
    artifact "Nestory APK\n<<artifact>>" as APK {
      component "UI Layer\nJetpack Compose" as UI
      component "Domain + ViewModel\nLayer" as Domain
      component "Data Layer\nRepositories + Managers" as Data
      component "OCR / Scanner\nML Kit" as OCR
      component "Vault Unlock\nBiometricPrompt" as Unlock
    }

    node "Device Hardware / System Services\n<<device service>>" as Services {
      component "Camera Service" as Camera
      component "Biometric Sensor /\nDevice Credential" as Credential
    }
  }

  node "Internal App Storage\n<<local storage>>" as Storage {
    database "Room SQLite DB\nnestory_database" as RoomDb
    artifact "DataStore /\nSharedPreferences" as Preferences
    artifact "Attachment Files\nscanned images" as Attachments
  }
}

UI -down-> Domain : user actions
Domain -down-> Data : state / use cases
UI -right-> OCR : scan
UI -right-> Unlock : unlock

Data -down-> RoomDb : Room / SQLite
Data -down-> Preferences : settings
Data -down-> Attachments : file I/O

OCR -right-> Camera : camera
Unlock -right-> Credential : auth API

legend bottom
Nestory is deployed as a native Android application.
No Web server, backend API, Firebase, or network service is deployed for this system.
endlegend

@enduml
